-left:20px;}#i92hf{margin-top:20px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:20px;}#ih1u6f{margin-top:20px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:20px;}#ieidn9{margin-bottom:5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0;}#iyl8dc{margin-bottom:5px;padding:0px 0px 0px 0;}#iqz5jf{margin:15px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#333;font-weight:bold;list-style-type:decimal;padding:0px 0px 0px 35px;}#i2714h{font-weight:normal;}#il1s5y{font-weight:normal;}#iu5y71{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.5;color:#333;padding:0px 0px 0px 20px;}#i7mb2m{margin-bottom:5px;}#i7kvs4{margin-bottom:5px;}#ivjagg{margin-bottom:5px;}#i742d8{margin:15px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#333;padding:0 0 0 35px;}#icx0zs{margin:10px 0px 10px 20px;line-height:1.5;color:#333;}#ic7lkl{margin-bottom:5px;}#iwvoqs{margin-bottom:5px;}#i3qqpp{margin:15px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#333;padding:0 0 0 35px;}#ijwrgm{margin:10px 0;line-height:1.5;color:#333;padding:0 0 0 20px;}</style>
    <body id="isue"><table id="il6t"><tbody><tr><td id="id3h"><img alt="2222.png" src="data:image/png;base64,"/></td><td id="icck"><div id="ip6qj"><span id="iwcvx"><b id="iym2x">ANTZ MANAGEMENT SDN. BHD.</b></span></div><p class="paragraph">[202101014333 (1413732-W)]<br/>47G, PUSAT PERDAGANGAN,JALAN KAMPAR BARAT1TAMAN KAMPAR BARAT,31900, KAMPAR,<br/>PERAK</p><section class="bdg-sect"></section></td></tr></tbody></table><section class="bdg-sect"><p id="ibold"><b>TENANCY MANAGEMENT AGREEMENT</b></p></section><section class="bdg-sect"><p id="i748k">This Agreement is made and entered into this____day of ___________________, __________________between ________________________, I/C___________________________with an address of ________________________________________________________________________(as the "Owner"), and <u>ANTZ MANAGEMENT SDN. BHD. (202101014333 (1413732-W))</u> (as the "Manager")</p></section><section class="bdg-sect"><p id="i3mvz"><b><u>General</u></b></p></section><section class="bdg-sect"><p id="i6gd2">Hereby, the Owner exclusively appoints the Manager to manage the property that is located at____________________________________________________________________________________________________.<br/><br/>The Manager hereby accepts such responsibility and agrees to manage the property aforementioned.<br/><br/>The Owner agrees to pay the fees associated with the services that the Manager will provide when managing the aforementioned property.</p></section><section class="bdg-sect"><p id="ig10k"><b><u>Responsibilities of Manager</u></b></p></section><section class="bdg-sect"><p id="i92hf">Owner hereby appoints the Manager as his lawful representative with full authority to do any and all lawful things necessary for the fulfillment of this Agreement, including the following:<br/><br/><b>Advertising of Property. </b>The Manager shall advertise the Property for rent, engage potentialtenant, enter into rental agreement(s) with acceptable renter(s). The Owner shall reimbursethe Manager the advertising expenses if the Owner request the specific advertisement for theproperty. The Manager shall notify the Owner, in advance, of anticipated expenses related tosuch Advertising.<br/><br/><b>Collection &amp; Disbursement of Rent.</b> The Manager shall be responsible for all collection ofRent earned on the Property. The Manager shall then be responsible for disbursement ofthose proceeds to the Owner on a timely basis. The Owner shall provide the Manager withdirection as to how proceeds shall be disbursed. The Manager shall further prepare andprovide to the Owner a detailed accounting of all rents, expenses, and disbursements. For thecase of refusal of payment, if the tenant keep ignore, refuse to reply the reminder and warning notices (3 notices) that send from the Manager, the Manager may proceed the <b>Eviction</b> action after discuss with the Owner, or propose the owner to enter the <b>Legal proceeding</b> if necessary.</p><section class="bdg-sect"><p id="ih1u6f"><b>Security Deposit.</b> The Manager is grant to collect and held the security deposits from thetenants on the Property. After the tenant check out, the Manager should deduct anyoutstanding payment of the tenant on the said property (outstanding rental, utilities bill,repair charges after check out, or others fees) from the security deposit and return theremaining amount to the tenant for returning the property to vacant possession.<br/><br/>If it is the breach contract case (tenant run away), the security deposit will be forfeited, and after deducting any outstanding payment of the tenant on the said property (outstandingrental, utilities bill, repair charges after check out, or others fees) from the security depositand return the remaining amount to the Owner for returning the property to vacant possession.<br/><br/><b>Maintenance &amp; Repair.</b> The Manager shall be responsible for performing, or hiringnecessary personnel to perform, all necessary maintenance and repairs to the Property. The Owner shall reimburse the Manager for the cost of all such maintenance and repairs.<br/><br/><b>Legal Proceedings.</b> In the event that collection and/or legal proceedings become necessarywith regard to the rental of the Property, The Manager shall hand-over the proceedings to theOwner or Owner's attorney, and giving any documents support or evidence to the OwnerThe Manager shall not be responsible for any legal proceedings that do not result from themanagement and rental of the Property. And Owner shall bear all expenses incurred in thepursuit of collection proceedings and/or legal proceedings.<br/><br/><b>Liability of Management.</b> Owner hereby agrees to hold Manager harmless from, and todefend Manager against any and all claims, charges, debts, demands and lawsuit of theherein-described property, any liability for injury on or about the property which may besuffered by any employee, tenant or guest upon the property. Owner shall provide a copy ofthe insurance policy to the Manager for the Manager's records.<br/><br/><b>Compensation of Management</b>. Owner agree to compensate Manager as follows :<br/></p></section></section><ol id="iqz5jf"><li id="ieidn9">New lease fee:<span id="i2714h">- Owner agrees to pay the Manager for new or renewal tenancy agreementas a fee equal to one hundred percent (100%) of the first full month's rent (12 monthscontract) as a fee for agency commission, referral fee or any recommendation fee</span></li><li id="iyl8dc">Admin fee:- <span id="il1s5y">Ten percent (10%) of all rents collected, (minimum RM 30.00 per month), asan admin fee for the managing works such as : monthly rental management (collection,monitoring, follow-up), utilities usage monitoring, handling tenants complain, repair requestservice and report prior to work being completed, repair coordination, detailed accounting of all rents, expenses, and disbursements of the property;<br/><br/>Which fees, plus any repair expenses, may be deducted by the Manager from rents, andfurther agrees to abide by the conditions set forth by the Manager to the tenant on the Owner's behalf.</span></li></ol><p id="iu5y71"><b>Other Compensation.</b> Unless otherwise stated, this Agreement does not include the service of preparing the Premises for sale or refinance, modernization, fire or major damagerestoration, rehabilitation, financial accounting or legal advice, representation before publicagencies, advising on proposed new construction, debt collection, counseling, attending any<br/>Association or Condominium meetings, and any other obligation not listed as a Service. If the Owner requests the Manager to perform services not included in this Agreement, a feeshall be agreed upon before such services are performed.<br/><br/><b>Evictions.</b> The Owner hereby gives power to the Manager to sign and serve notices on theOwner's behalf and prosecute actions to evict tenants; recover possession of the Premises;recover rents and other sums due; and, when expedient, settle, compromise and releaseclaims, actions, and suits and/or reinstate tenancies.<br/><br/><b>Lease Alterations.</b> The Owner hereby gives power to the Manager to initiate, sign, renew, modify, or cancel rental agreements and leases for the Premises, or any part thereof andcollect and give receipts for rents, other fees, charges, and security deposits.<br/><br/><b>Tenant Fees.</b> The Property Manager may receive and charge the tenants for:</p><ul id="i742d8"><li id="i7mb2m">Agreement preparation fees and stamping fees;</li><li id="i7kvs4">Late payment penalty; and</li><li id="ivjagg">Any other service that provide by the Manager that are not conflict with the agreement suchas: cleaning service, internet wifi, laundry charges, or ...<br/></li></ul><p id="icx0zs"><b>Termination. </b>This Agreement may be terminated any time with the condition of:</p><ul id="i3qqpp"><li id="ic7lkl">The property is in vacant possession; and</li><li id="iwvoqs">Either party upon 30 days written notice to the other party.</li></ul><p id="ijwrgm">Upon termination, the Manager shall disburse to the Owner any monies in the Manager's possession due and owing to the Owner within thirty (30) days from the date of termination. The Owner shall reimburse the Manager for any expenses incurred or approved prior to the date of termination within thirty (30) days from the date of termination.<br/><br/><b>Successors and Assigns.</b> This Agreement shall be binding upon and inure to the benefit ofthe successors and assigns of Manager and the heirs, administrators, successors, and assignsof the Owner. Notwithstanding the preceding sentence, Manager shall not assign its interestunder this Agreement except in connection with the sale of all or substantially all of theassets of its business. In the event of such sale, Manager shall be released from all liabilityunder this Agreement upon the express assumption of such liability by its assignee.This document represents the entire Agreement between the parties hereto.<br/><br/>IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties hereto hereby execute this Agreement on the date first<br/>abovewritten.<br/><br/>__________________________________                                                          _________________________________<br/>Owner                                                                                                                   The Manager<br/><br/></p></body>
HTML;

